"""
Workflow 12 -- Evaluation of fine-tuned Borzoi trunks on the FOLD_1 test set.

Evaluates an ensemble of replicate Borzoi trunks (config
finetuning.borzoi.evaluation, one directory per replicate under
results/finetuning/borzoi/trunk_r{0..3}) fine-tuned on the SF3B1 RNA-seq
tracks (2 samples x 2 strands).

Two rules per subset, as in workflows/06-evaluation and workflows/10-jax_finetuning:
  1. collect_predictions -- GPU: inference per trunk, untransform (soft clip /
                            sqrt / scale), mean over trunks, then the RNA-seq
                            prediction parquets in the AlphaGenome schema
  2. compute_metrics     -- CPU: src/scripts/compute_eval_metrics.py, unchanged,
                            so metrics.parquet is directly comparable to the
                            AlphaGenome runs (mean-pooled convention); plus
                            compute_metrics_borzoi_native.py -> metrics_native.json,
                            the upstream metrics at Borzoi's native 32 bp view
                            (bin sums, exon-base-weighted gene means)

Inference uses the unmodified upstream evaluation code (scripts/upstream/,
abuendia/alphagenome-pytorch, branch abuen/borzoi-eval). The parquet helpers are
verbatim copies of the AlphaGenome ones (scripts/rna_eval_helpers.py; keep them in
sync with scripts/check_helpers_sync.py).

Subsets:
  test          -- held-out test intervals
  train_sample  -- seeded random sample of train intervals, same size as test

Outputs:
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/predictions/{regions.parquet,run_info.json}
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/predictions/*.parquet (AlphaGenome schema)
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/predictions/borzoi_native_32bp_*.parquet
  results/evaluation/borzoi/full/{subset}/metrics.parquet, metrics.json, metrics_native.json

Run with:
    snakemake -s workflows/12-borzoi_evaluation/Snakefile --use-conda [-n]

Submit real runs via SLURM, not on the login node:
    ./src/scripts/submit_snakemake_slurm.sh \\
        "snakemake -s workflows/12-borzoi_evaluation/Snakefile --use-conda -j 2 --rerun-incomplete"
"""

configfile: "config/config.yaml"

include: "rules/evaluate.smk"

rule all:
    input:
        EVAL_TARGETS,
